! DIAGNOSTIC ARM, not a physics result.
!
! The simple shower with SpaceShower:dipoleRecoil switched OFF, so the ISR
! recoil is taken by the SCATTERED LEPTON instead of by the final-state
! parton.  It exists to answer one question: when PartonShowers:model is
! changed to Vincia or Dire, how much of the shift in the DIS kinematics is
! the shower ALGORITHM and how much is simply that the base card's
! `SpaceShower:dipoleRecoil = on` is a SimpleShower setting that the other two
! models never read?
!
! If this arm reproduces the Vincia/Dire shift in <Q2>, the shift is a recoil
! artefact and must not be reported as a shower-model uncertainty.
SpaceShower:dipoleRecoil = off
